  // A day lasts DaySeconds of the world's time. A new world begins at StartHour. The sun rises at
  // Sunrise and sets at Sunset, reaching HighestSun degrees above the horizon; the moon reaches
  // HighestMoon. One light plays both, drawn no lower than LowestLight degrees, and changes at sunrise
  // and sunset, so the keys bring its Energy to 0 at both. With the day and night turned off in the
  // settings, it is always HeldHour.
