  "Sunrise": 6.0,
  "Sunset": 20.0,
  "HeldHour": 16.2,
  "HighestSun": 62.0,
  "HighestMoon": 48.0,
  "LowestLight": 7.0,

  // People leave off between HomeFrom and HomeBy, each at their own hour, and walk home along the
  // village's ways at HomeSpeed m/s, up to MostHurry times faster when the game runs fast. They go in
  // at the door, DoorReach metres from the house's centre, and by IndoorsBy everybody is in. They rise
  // between UpFrom and UpBy and come out of the same door (ADR-080). Windows show Lamplight, and a
  // light of ShrineLight strength burns by each shrine, reaching ShrineLightReach metres.
